  "title": "Scripps to release first-quarter 2026 operating results on May 7",
  "summary": "CINCINNATI – The E.W. Scripps Company (NASDAQ: SSP) will report first-quarter 2026 operating results after the markets close on Thursday, May 7. The call with the company’s senior management team will take place at 9:30 a.m. Eastern time on Friday, May 8.",
